      "description": "<p>The castaway launches into a nonsensical verbal stream of consciousness. Creatures in a 30ft Type:emanation must succeed at a DC 19 Will Saving Throw save or be Confused for 1 round. Once a creature has succeeded at a save against the castaway's Cockamamie Rant, they are immune to its effects for 24 hours.</p>",
