      "actions": 3,
      "traits": [
        "manipulate",
        "trap"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> five times per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> By scrounging local materials, the castaway constructs a simple but effective deadfall without expending resources. Treat this as a snare with a Basic DC 19 Perception  check to spot, and a Basic DC 23 Thievery  check to disable. It occupies a single 5-foot square and lasts 24 hours before falling apart. The first creature that enters the space takes 6d6 Bludgeoning Damage damage (Basic DC 22 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>",
